            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To fight? (ਲੜਨਾ, laṛnā.) A quarrel? (ਝਗੜਾ, jhagṛā.) To hit? (ਮਾਰਨਾ, mārnā.) A swear word? (ਗਾਲ੍ਹ, gālh.) A reconciliation? (ਸੁਲ੍ਹਾ, sulhā.) A particular time? (ਵੇਲਾ, velā.) To go by (of time)? (ਬੀਤਣਾ, bītṇā.) An era? (ਜ਼ਮਾਨਾ, zamānā.) To regret? (ਪਛਤਾਉਣਾ, pachhtāuṇā.) To spend time? (ਗੁਜ਼ਾਰਨਾ, guzārnā.) To fly? (ਉੱਡਣਾ, uḍḍṇā.) To burst? (ਫੁੱਟਣਾ, phuṭṭṇā.) A collision? (ਟੱਕਰ, ṭakkar.) To sink? (ਡੁੱਬਣਾ, ḍubbṇā.) A boatman? (ਮਲਾਹ, malāh.) How someone is feeling? (ਤਬੀਅਤ, tabīat.) How things stand? (ਹਾਲ, hāl.) Health? (ਸਿਹਤ, sihat.) Healthy? (ਤੰਦਰੁਸਤ, tandrusat.) Well again after an illness? (ਰਾਜ਼ੀ, rāzī.) A doctor? (ਡਾਕਟਰ, ḍākṭar.) A patient? (ਮਰੀਜ਼, marīz.) Medical treatment? (ਇਲਾਜ, ilāj.) The pulse? (ਨਬਜ਼, nabaz.) An injection? (ਟੀਕਾ, ṭīkā.) A head cold? (ਜ਼ੁਕਾਮ, zukām.) A cough? (ਖੰਘ, khaṅgh.) A sneeze? (ਛਿੱਕ, chhikk.) Breath? (ਸਾਹ, sāh.) To swallow? (ਨਿਗਲਣਾ, nigalṇā.) An injury? (ਸੱਟ, saṭṭ.) A wound? (ਜ਼ਖ਼ਮ, zakham.) To swell up? (ਸੁੱਜਣਾ, sujjṇā.) A bandage? (ਪੱਟੀ, paṭṭī.) An ointment? (ਮਲ੍ਹਮ, malham.)"
